<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12472] Checkstyle rule &quot;NewlineAtEndOfFile&quot; is broken on Windows systems.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12472</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Checkstyle rule &quot;NewlineAtEndOfFile&quot; uses OS EOL character.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MCHECKSTYLE-376&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MCHECKSTYLE-376&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It could be fixed by explicit configuration of LF as EOL. Checked on TC, there are no checkstyle related failures. Also checked on Windows locally. Also there are no problems.&lt;br/&gt;
Problems are possible for Windows user in case of invalid Git configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
